{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Cubes</strong> is a colorful puzzle adventure in which you control four unique cubes to solve spatial challenges. Switch between the cubes, activate buttons, overcome spikes, collect coins and solve puzzles in a relaxing yet brain-teasing experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.poster.avif?t=1774628227\" width=744 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.webm?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/974e8b49e91fe98e19c6539f128af901.mp4?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Activate buttons using surface of the cubes with the same color of buttons</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Stay away from the spikes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Overcome obstacles to reach the coins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Collect coins</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Complete levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/594590cbfacaa61a144d2b2cba05b18b.poster.avif?t=1774628227\" width=744 height=242 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/594590cbfacaa61a144d2b2cba05b18b.webm?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/594590cbfacaa61a144d2b2cba05b18b.mp4?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Over 40 levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Different type of obstacles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Challenging levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Steam Achievments</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Steam Cloud</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 Gamepad support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each side of the cubes can be seen via UI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/28950648a595e0fc62636881a19860e2.poster.avif?t=1774628227\" width=328 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/28950648a595e0fc62636881a19860e2.webm?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936790/extras/28950648a595e0fc62636881a19860e2.mp4?t=1774628227\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Rolling Cubes","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3936790/3259406ee25f17231ccc6e1e4511bf163faae839.jpg"},{"name":"Good Start","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3936790/218d49151f28d4f9b8539bf5ba8712d124e46017.jpg"},{"name":"You Like Rolling...","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/39